{"unit_id":"tag:0ADK:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个态射族（family of morphisms），它们是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射，且具有固定目标<MATH_0004>。\n置<MATH_0005>。\n有一个典范（canonical）的范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0002>相对于族<MATHSEG_0003>下降（descent）数据的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0004>相对于<MATHSEG_0005>\n它将<MATH_0006>映射（maps）到<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>且<MATH_0009>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"具有相同目标的族。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的来源与目标。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"范畴之间的等价。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"两种下降数据之间的等价。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"相对于族或余积的下降数据。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"下降数据的范畴。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"等价在对象上的作用。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADT:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）（《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》，定义<REF_0001>）。\n有一个范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据<MATHSEG_0002>相对于<MATHSEG_0003>层（sheaves）<MATHSEG_0004>位于<MATHSEG_0005>上，并配备<MATHSEG_0006>一个映射（map）<MATHSEG_0007>，使得每个<MATHSEG_0008>是一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATHSEG_0009>\n此外，\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>右边的代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>对应于左边的<MATH_0005>，并且\n<STRUCT_0003>层（sheaf）<MATH_0006>是一个代数空间（algebraic space）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>我们稍后将看到，若<MATH_0007>不太大（large），则总是如此，见 Bootstrap，引理<REF_0002>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>当且仅当相应的下降（descent）数据<MATH_0008>是有效（effective）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":["Bootstrap"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"fppf覆盖的空间。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"进行下降的覆盖。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用空间上的拓扑章。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"下降数据与层的等价。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"配备到目标的映射的层。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"层到目标的映射。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"层的表示性质。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"下降数据对应的层。"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大","context":"索引集合的大小。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"下降数据的有效性。"}],"notes":[]}
